// 工作台「工作日誌」頁（對應 C# UI/Work/WorkLogPage.xaml）：照計時紀錄整理的任務與時數，加上自己在網頁寫的日誌。
// 契約：匯出 global WorkLogPageData（Rust 端用 window.global::<WorkLogPageData>() 讀寫）與 component WorkLogPage；
// 這兩個名稱與檔名不可改（workspace.slint 依此匯入）。
import { Theme, ScrollView } from "@hb/index.slint";
import { GroupLabel, StatusLine, TextArea, PlainText, LinkButton } from "@hbc/index.slint";
import { W2, W2Button, W2Card, W2Confirm, W2Title } from "w2-common.slint";

export struct WorkLogRow {
    task: string,
    hours: string,
    ranges: string,
}

export global WorkLogPageData {
    in-out property <bool> loading;
    in-out property <string> date-text;
    in-out property <bool> today-enabled;
    in-out property <string> total-text;
    in-out property <string> status-text;
    in-out property <int> status-tone;
    in-out property <[WorkLogRow]> entries;
    in-out property <bool> empty;
    in-out property <bool> copy-enabled;
    in-out property <string> note-text;
    in-out property <bool> note-visible;
    in-out property <string> draft-button: "✦ Claude 整理";
    in-out property <bool> draft-enabled: true;
    in-out property <bool> draft-visible;
    in-out property <string> draft-info;
    in-out property <string> draft-text;
    in-out property <string> notes-button;
    in-out property <bool> notes-enabled;
    in-out property <bool> capture-enabled: true;
    in-out property <bool> confirm-open;
    in-out property <string> confirm-title;
    in-out property <string> confirm-text;
    callback confirm-ok();
    callback confirm-cancel();
    callback prev();
    callback next();
    callback today();
    callback copy();
    callback draft();
    callback close-draft();
    callback copy-draft();
    callback capture-draft();
    callback apply-notes();
    callback open-entries();
    callback open-web();
}

export component WorkLogPage inherits Rectangle {
    VerticalLayout {
        padding-left: W2.pad-x;
        padding-right: W2.pad-x;
        padding-top: W2.pad-top;
        padding-bottom: W2.pad-bottom;
        spacing: 10px;

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 8px;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
            W2Title {
                text: "工作日誌";
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
            }
            W2Button {
                text: "‹";
                tip: "前一天";
                font-size: 15px;
                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.prev(); }
            }
            Text {
                text: WorkLogPageData.date-text;
                min-width: 120px;
                color: Theme.ink;
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 600;
                horizontal-alignment: center;
                vertical-alignment: center;
            }
            W2Button {
                text: "›";
                tip: "後一天";
                font-size: 15px;
                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.next(); }
            }
            W2Button {
                text: "今天";
                enabled: WorkLogPageData.today-enabled;
                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.today(); }
            }
        }

        Rectangle {
            vertical-stretch: 0;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            border-radius: W2.card-radius;
            HorizontalLayout {
                padding: 16px;
                spacing: 6px;
                VerticalLayout {
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    alignment: center;
                    Text {
                        text: WorkLogPageData.total-text;
                        color: Theme.ink;
                        font-family: Theme.font-num;
                        font-size: 22px;
                        font-weight: 600;
                    }
                    Text {
                        text: "照計時紀錄整理；同時計時的時間各任務都會算";
                        color: Theme.muted;
                        font-size: 11.5px;
                    }
                }
                W2Button {
                    y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                    text: WorkLogPageData.draft-button;
                    primary: true;
                    enabled: WorkLogPageData.draft-enabled;
                    tip: "把這天的 Claude Code 對話與 commit 整理成日誌草稿，也能寫進計時段的備註";
                    clicked => { WorkLogPageData.draft(); }
                }
                W2Button {
                    y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                    text: "複製成文字";
                    enabled: WorkLogPageData.copy-enabled;
                    tip: "複製成「任務 時數」清單，貼到日報";
                    clicked => { WorkLogPageData.copy(); }
                }
                W2Button {
                    y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                    text: "工時紀錄";
                    tip: "查看、修改、補登這天的計時";
                    clicked => { WorkLogPageData.open-entries(); }
                }
                W2Button {
                    y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                    text: "在網頁寫日誌 ↗";
                    clicked => { WorkLogPageData.open-web(); }
                }
            }
        }

        StatusLine {
            text: WorkLogPageData.status-text;
            tone: WorkLogPageData.status-tone;
        }

        sv := ScrollView {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            content-height: body.preferred-height;
            body := VerticalLayout {
                width: sv.visible-width - 14px;
                spacing: 8px;
                if WorkLogPageData.draft-visible: VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 6px;
                    padding-bottom: 6px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        GroupLabel {
                            text: "Claude 整理的草稿";
                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                            vertical-alignment: bottom;
                        }
                        LinkButton {
                            text: "收起";
                            clicked => { WorkLogPageData.close-draft(); }
                        }
                    }
                    W2Card {
                        outline: true;
                        spacing: 8px;
                        pad-y: 14px;
                        Text {
                            text: WorkLogPageData.draft-info;
                            color: Theme.muted;
                            font-size: 11.5px;
                            wrap: word-wrap;
                        }
                        TextArea {
                            min-height: 140px;
                            preferred-height: 260px;
                            max-height: 360px;
                            text <=> WorkLogPageData.draft-text;
                            font-size: 12px;
                        }
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            spacing: 6px;
                            padding-top: 4px;
                            W2Button {
                                text: "複製";
                                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.copy-draft(); }
                            }
                            W2Button {
                                text: "存到隨手記";
                                enabled: WorkLogPageData.capture-enabled;
                                tip: "把上面的草稿（可以先改）存到 Hayaku 的隨手記";
                                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.capture-draft(); }
                            }
                            W2Button {
                                text: WorkLogPageData.notes-button;
                                enabled: WorkLogPageData.notes-enabled;
                                tip: "只寫進還沒有備註的計時段，內容是那段時間裡同一個任務送出的指令與 commit";
                                clicked => { WorkLogPageData.apply-notes(); }
                            }
                            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                        }
                    }
                }
                for e in WorkLogPageData.entries: Rectangle {
                    background: Theme.fill;
                    border-radius: 16px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        padding-left: 16px;
                        padding-right: 16px;
                        padding-top: 10px;
                        padding-bottom: 10px;
                        VerticalLayout {
                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                            Text {
                                text: e.task;
                                color: Theme.ink;
                                font-weight: 600;
                                overflow: elide;
                            }
                            Text {
                                text: e.ranges;
                                color: Theme.muted;
                                font-family: Theme.font-num;
                                font-size: 11.5px;
                                wrap: word-wrap;
                            }
                        }
                        Text {
                            text: e.hours;
                            color: Theme.ink;
                            font-family: Theme.font-num;
                            font-size: 15px;
                            vertical-alignment: center;
                        }
                    }
                }
                if WorkLogPageData.empty: Text {
                    text: "這天沒有計時紀錄";
                    color: Theme.muted;
                    height: 36px;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    x: 4px;
                }
                if WorkLogPageData.note-visible: VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 6px;
                    padding-top: 6px;
                    GroupLabel {
                        text: "我寫的日誌";
                    }
                    W2Card {
                        PlainText {
                            text: WorkLogPageData.note-text;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    W2Confirm {
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        open: WorkLogPageData.confirm-open;
        heading: WorkLogPageData.confirm-title;
        message: WorkLogPageData.confirm-text;
        ok => { WorkLogPageData.confirm-ok(); }
        cancel => { WorkLogPageData.confirm-cancel(); }
    }
}
